)\\in P^{\\mathfrak A}\n\\leftrightarrow(h(a_1),\\ldots,h(a_n))\\in P^{\\mathfrak B}\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A} \\cong_S \\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A} \\cong_S \\mathfrak{B}\\)</span> : 存在保持全部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>-符号解释的双射</li>\n<li>元组的逐坐标像已显式写出，避免把未定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"h(\\vec a)\">\\(h(\\vec a)\\)</span>用于关系解释。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"1fd20a9a341b65d3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-bijective]]","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A}, \\mathfrak{B}$ (candidate $S$-structures, see [[88-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-bijective","status":"resolved","id":"1fd20a9a341b65d3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (bijection predicate, see [[88-df-bijective]])","embed":false},{"target":"88-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3a560d130315ebdc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Const}_S,\\mathrm{Func}_S^n,\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$ (signature components, see [[88-df-structure]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A}, \\mathfrak{B}","display":false